"><span>builder.Services.AddControllers();

builder.Services.AddEndpointsApiExplorer();</span>
<mark>builder.Services.AddSwaggerGen();</mark>
<span></span></code></pre>
<p>The call to <a href=3D"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/micr=
osoft.extensions.dependencyinjection.endpointmetadataapiexplorerservicecoll=
ectionextensions.addendpointsapiexplorer" class=3D"no-loc" data-linktype=3D=
"absolute-path">AddEndpointsApiExplorer</a> shown in the preceding example =
is required only for <a href=3D"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/co=
re/fundamentals/minimal-apis/overview" data-linktype=3D"absolute-path">mini=
mal APIs</a>. For more information, see <a href=3D"https://stackoverflow.co=
m/a/71933535" data-linktype=3D"external">this StackOverflow post</a>.</p>
<p>Enable the middleware for serving the generated JSON document and the Sw=
agger UI, also in <code>Program.cs</code>:</p>
<div class=3D"codeHeader" id=3D"code-try-4" data-bi-name=3D"code-header"><s=
pan class=3D"language">C#</span>
