g the UI to match your theme.</p>
<div class=3D"heading-wrapper" data-heading-level=3D"h3"><a class=3D"anchor=
-link docon docon-link" href=3D"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/co=
re/tutorials/getting-started-with-swashbuckle?view=3Daspnetcore-7.0&amp;tab=
s=3Dvisual-studio-code#api-info-and-description" aria-label=3D"Section titl=
ed: API info and description"></a><h3 id=3D"api-info-and-description" class=
=3D"heading-anchor">API info and description</h3></div>
<p>The configuration action passed to the <code>AddSwaggerGen</code> method=
 adds information such as the author, license, and description.</p>
<p>In <code>Program.cs</code>, import the following namespace to use the <c=
ode>OpenApiInfo</code> class:</p>
<div class=3D"codeHeader" id=3D"code-try-7" data-bi-name=3D"code-header"><s=
pan class=3D"language">C#</span>
