s=3Dvisual-studio-code#xml-comments" aria-label=3D"Section titled: XML comm=
ents"></a><h3 id=3D"xml-comments" class=3D"heading-anchor">XML comments</h3=
></div>
<p>XML comments can be enabled with the following approaches:</p>
<div class=3D"tabGroup" id=3D"tabgroup_2" data-bi-name=3D"tab-group">
<ul role=3D"tablist">
<li role=3D"presentation">
